# device.table: modes and owners in the root, applied under fakeroot after
# Buildroot's system/device_table.txt (BR2_ROOTFS_DEVICE_TABLE, makedevs
# format: name type mode uid gid major minor start inc count).
# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
#
# Device nodes come from devtmpfs (BR2_ROOTFS_DEVICE_CREATION_DYNAMIC_DEVTMPFS),
# so this table makes none, and never /dev/block/by-name (IMPLEMENTATION B.5).
# It names the directories the init scripts mount over or write links into,
# so their modes do not depend on the build host's umask:
#   /storage   the data partition's mount point (S00base)
#   /run, /tmp tmpfs mount points (S00base mounts them 0755 and 1777)
#   /system and the link targets of post-build.d/10-android-links.sh
#   /usr/libexec/thimsy/android-bin  the curated /system/bin (B.5)
# Not /root: post-build.d/30-permissions.sh makes it a link into /storage.
#
# name                               type mode uid gid major minor start inc count
/storage                             d    755  0   0   -     -     -     -   -
/run                                 d    755  0   0   -     -     -     -   -
/tmp                                 d    1777 0   0   -     -     -     -   -
/system                              d    755  0   0   -     -     -     -   -
/usr/share/thimsy                    d    755  0   0   -     -     -     -   -
/usr/share/thimsy/system/etc         d    755  0   0   -     -     -     -   -
/usr/share/fonts/thimsy              d    755  0   0   -     -     -     -   -
/usr/libexec/thimsy/android-bin      d    755  0   0   -     -     -     -   -
